===Etymology 1===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*(s)kleh₂w-}}
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*kľučь}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-bsl-pro|*kljaukjas}}, from {{inh|ru|ine-pro||*klewk-yo-s}}, from {{m|ine-pro||*kle(h₂)uk-}}, an extended form of {{m|ine-pro|*(s)kleh₂w-||hook, key, peg}}, whence {{cog|en|clef}} and {{m|en|close}}.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|b|adj=ключево́й,клю́чный|dim=клю́чик}}

# [[key]]
# [[wrench]], [[spanner]], [[screw wrench]]
# [[clue]], [[key]]
# {{lb|ru|music}} [[clef]], [[key]]
# [[radical]] {{qualifier|in Chinese characters}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively|usually with {{m|ru|в}}}} [[way]], [[vein]] (about the tone, character or manner of something)
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в]] [[тот же|том же]] '''ключе́'''|in the same '''vein''' / along the same '''lines'''}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в]] [[э́том]] '''ключе́'''|in this/that '''vein'''/'''regard'''/'''context'''/'''way'''/'''manner'''}}

